#Negatives
custom-frame-trait-overvolted-i-name = Overvolted
custom-frame-trait-overvolted-i-description = Your frame was built with an overvolted power supply. (+25% power drain)

custom-frame-trait-cheap-oil-filter-name = Cheap Oil Filter
custom-frame-trait-cheap-oil-filter-description = Your frame was built with a cheap oil filter making it unable to recycle oil. (Disables oil regeneration)

custom-frame-trait-compromised-integrity-name = Compromised Integrity
custom-frame-trait-compromised-integrity-description = Your frame was built with a cheaper grade of plasteel. (-15% Pierce, -15% Slash, and -10% Blunt resistance) 

custom-frame-trait-radiation-vulnerability-name = Radiation Vulnerability
custom-frame-trait-radiation-vulnerability-description = Your frame was built with a cheaper grade of radiation protection. (-30% Radiation resistance and +50% duration to Ion storm glitches)

custom-frame-trait-microreactor-incompatibility-name = Microreactor Incompatibility
custom-frame-trait-microreactor-incompatibility-description = Your frame was built with delicate internals that cannot withstand the radiation from a microreactor. (Disables microreactors insertion)

custom-frame-trait-heavier-frame-name = Heavier Frame
custom-frame-trait-heavier-frame-description = Your frame was built with a cheaper but heavier plasteel alloy. The heavier materials made you slower and to compensate the weight your servos are stronger but louder. (Louder footsteps and 5% slowdown)

custom-frame-trait-integrated-battery-name = Integrated Battery 
custom-frame-trait-integrated-battery-description = Your frame was built with an integrated battery of higher capacity. The tradeoff is that you can't remove it.

custom-frame-trait-outdated-wiring-name = Outdated Wiring
custom-frame-trait-outdated-wiring-description = Your frame uses an outdated insulated wiring that cannot drain power from APCs, forcing you to use Cyborg Chargers to recharge. 

#Positives
custom-frame-trait-undervolted-i-name = Undervolted I
custom-frame-trait-undervolted-i-description = Your frame was built with a slightly undervolted power supply. (-15% power drain)

custom-frame-trait-undervolted-ii-name = Undervolted II
custom-frame-trait-undervolted-ii-description = Your frame was built with an undervolted power supply. (-30% power drain)

custom-frame-trait-language-database-name = Language Database
custom-frame-trait-language-database-description = Your frame was built with an integrated language database implant. However due to memory storage, you can only have one extra language installed at a time.

custom-frame-trait-repair-nanites-name = Repair Nanites
custom-frame-trait-repair-nanites-description = Your frame was built with an integrated nanite replicator capable repairing your chassis on command but at the cost of extra power. (Adds an ability that can toggle regeneration on and off)

custom-frame-trait-module-compatibility-name = Module Compatibility
custom-frame-trait-module-compatibility-description = Your frame was built with the ability to support cyborg modules. (Allows cyborg modules to be installed)
custom-frame-trait-module-compatibility-menu-selection = Cyborg Module Selection
custom-frame-trait-module-compatibility-menu-description = So many possibilities..

custom-frame-trait-overclocking-name = Overclocking
custom-frame-trait-overclocking-description = Your frame was built with the ability to redirect power from your fans directly to your integrated servos, causing you to complete tasks faster. (Adds an ability that can improve your speed in things such as building, deconstructing, etc)

custom-frame-trait-better-insulation-name = Better Insulation
custom-frame-trait-better-insulation-description = Your frame was built with better insulating materials making you harder to electrocute. (Adds electrocution protection. Not full insulated gloves!)

custom-frame-trait-blood-powered-name = Blood Powered
custom-frame-trait-blood-powered-description = Your frame was build with a rather esoteric fluid power system. It's capable of minor repairs and recharging on its own, but at the cost of requiring blood. (Blood heals you and recharges your battery. However your battery isn't swappable and you lose the ability to recharge from APCs)
custom-frame-trait-blood-powered-healed = You feel the blood restoring your body.